// index.malloy: this package's published surface.
//
// Publisher treats a package's index.malloy as the list of what it publishes.
// Because this file is here, you do not need an "explores" key in
// publisher.json: the discovery surface is whatever this file exports.
//
// `export { ... }` is the curation. Add a source here to publish it; leave one
// out to keep it as an internal building block that other models can still
// import and join. Everything stays queryable by name either way. To also make
// the surface a query boundary, so unlisted sources cannot be queried at all,
// declare "explores" explicitly in publisher.json (see docs/discovery-and-access.md).

import "{{modelFile}}"

export { {{sourceName}} }
